:: Quest_cleaning_the_duke_s_manor [nobr]
<<questimage 'clean_duke_manor.jpg'>>

<p>
    The Duke <<Rep $g.valeduke>> in the <<lore region_vale>> is hiring seasonal help to keep his manor clean.
    It seems an easy enough job for your slavers to accomplish,
    plus this Duke is certain to have valuables laying around somewhere.
</p>


