<p>
    Your slavers arrived at the manor and got to work immediately after changing into their maid uniforms. The three of them split up and began casing
    the place. After an hour, they reconvene and <<rep $g.thief>> informed the group <<they $g.thief>> spotted a jewelry box in the master bedroom that <<they $g.thief>> thief|think <<they $g.thief>> can break into.
</p>

<p>
    At the end of the week, they spring their plan into action. <<Rep $g.leadmaid>> entered the Duke's office to clean it, feeling the Duke's gaze follow <<them $g.leadmaid>> around the room as <<they $g.leadmaid>> stretched up to dust the high up spaces, or bent down to clean the floor. <<Rep $g.leadmaid>> teased the Duke for minutes on end, before <<uadv $g.leadmaid>> claiming <<they $g.leadmaid>> needed to clean under the Duke's desk.
